/**
 * Deck plans for the Ships section (Shaun's order, 2026-11-04:
 * "Make all the deck plans connect to the ship titles. Make
 * the ship titles clickable so you can see the deck plans.").
 *
 * Keyed by ship record id; each value is the plan sheet(s) on
 * file for that hull — class plans first, then named-ship
 * sheets. Images: scans of the printed plans gathered in the
 * 2026-11-04 pass-2 hunt (Spelljammer Wiki scans of the
 * original books; per-file sources in
 * library-staging/ship-maps/SOURCES.md), plus the "Zanderin"
 * Sprint Freighter sheet from Shaun's own Airships preview.
 * This module is loaded lazily by step-ships.tsx (dynamic
 * import) so the plans never weigh down the main bundle.
 */
